{"3220260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hexachess", "steam_appid": 3220260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning was chess, and chess was good. Then chess got too good, and thus chess became less good. But then chess got Hexagon, and harmony ensued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pretty polished lean implementation of Władysław Gliński's Hexagonal Chess. The game itself is pretty old (~75 years) and got lost to time with its creator's death. It's worth another life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's similar to usual chess we all know &amp; love, but it uses hexes instead of default square grid. That changes the whole meta, invalidating tons of pre-existing memorized plays &amp; allowing for actually experiencing the game anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hotseat (local multiplayer)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing against AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer with matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple beautiful maps to play on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive game chat</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning was chess, and chess was good. Then chess got too good, and thus chess became less good. But then chess got Hexagon, and harmony ensued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pretty polished lean implementation of Władysław Gliński's Hexagonal Chess. The game itself is pretty old (~75 years) and got lost to time with its creator's death. It's worth another life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's similar to usual chess we all know &amp; love, but it uses hexes instead of default square grid. That changes the whole meta, invalidating tons of pre-existing memorized plays &amp; allowing for actually experiencing the game anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hotseat (local multiplayer)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing against AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer with matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple beautiful maps to play on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive game chat</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Chess on hexagonal field with local play, online multiplayer &amp; against AI. Based on Gliński's chess variant.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220260/11b3caea0fb3bf07438da5da2e4fb1ab05e8d33d/header.jpg?t=1767964951", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220260/4e48291404fc87108ff22b656b74a91ac09ab940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767964951", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220260/4e48291404fc87108ff22b656b74a91ac09ab940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767964951", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1080 / AMD Radeon 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-11700K / AMD Ryzen 7 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 4070 / AMD Radeon RX 6950 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Tricky Cha